fa6044eb8ef29e1a370f4bc8b333b17c1c0b03cabccccc19ccc9b9b0e704c93e{"version":1,"source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"},"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"operatingKpis":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"f137319a36e5a233d33ad539fb5b9dd802c6236d1e4238527b643105a34a1a44","quote":"(c) Subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement, at the Closing the Company shall deliver or cause to be delivered to the Purchaser (i) a shareholder statement for such number of Shares, (ii) a Warrant to purchase such number of Shares and (iii) any other documents required to be delivered pursuant to this Agreement. At the time of the Closing, the Purchaser shall have delivered its Purchase Price by transferring to the digital wallet designated by the Company an amount of Solv-BTC equal to such Purchase Price as set forth on the signature page hereto executed by such Purchaser, based on the Reference Rate determined in accordance with Section 1.2.","context":"在交割的所有条件被满足或豁免的前提下，证券单位的买卖在所有条件都已满足或已取得豁免的当日时（“交割日”）通过电子方式交换签署页及文件远程完成（“交割”）。","section":"","block":26,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"ee70edb28a5adbd3a6c72eac06bfb8ceda2e3141d052c3b49a716cabb98d6445","quote":"根据本协议的规定，在交割时公司应向购买人送达或使他人向购买人送达 (i) 写有购买人名字的普通股股东声明，(ii) 一份可购买特定数量普通股的期权，以及(iii)其他任何根据本条款应送达的文件。在交割时，购买人应通过向公司指定的数字钱包转入与该购买价格等值的Solv-BTC支付其购买价格，具体金额以该购买人签署的签署页所列为准，并应根据第1.2节确定的参考汇率计算。","context":"(c) Subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement, at the Closing the Company shall deliver or cause to be delivered to the Purchaser (i) a shareholder statement for such number of Shares, (ii) a Warrant to purchase such number of Shares and (iii) any other documents required to be delivered pursuant to this Agreement. At the time of the Closing, the Purchaser shall have delivered its Purchase Price by transferring to the digital wallet designated by the Company an amount of Solv-BTC equal to such Purchase Price as set forth on the signature page hereto executed by such Purchaser, based on the Reference Rate determined in accordance with Section 1.2.","section":"","block":27,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"3636f94b11a13c79d71e1a0c75f54d29395cca330db6bb32c9b1f185629fcb4f","quote":"(a) The Purchaser shall satisfy payment of the Purchase Price by delivering a number of units of Solv-BTC having a U.S. Dollar value equal to the Purchase Price. The U.S. Dollar value of each unit of Solv-BTC shall be equal to the spot price of one (1) Solv-BTC as reported by CoinMarketCap (coinmarketcap.com) at 5:00 p.m. New York City time on the business day immediately preceding the date of pricing (the “Reference Time”).","context":"第1.2节 数字货币支付。","section":"","block":30,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"8744344de6eefbbf339ff9ba532e923caea1251e75bd5cf09adc2a613d265330","quote":"The number of units of Solv-BTC to be delivered at the Closing shall be calculated by dividing the Purchase Price by the Reference Rate (as defined above), rounded down to four (4) decimal places.","context":"(a) The Purchaser shall satisfy payment of the Purchase Price by delivering a number of units of Solv-BTC having a U.S. Dollar value equal to the Purchase Price. The U.S. Dollar value of each unit of Solv-BTC shall be equal to the spot price of one (1) Solv-BTC as reported by CoinMarketCap (coinmarketcap.com) at 5:00 p.m. New York City time on the business day immediately preceding the date of pricing (the “Reference Time”).","section":"","block":31,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"4248e88846703f4aa6c92ae97001e9b4f0371905835adeeb997221ee5ed30476","quote":"The Company shall provide the Purchaser with its designated digital wallet address for receiving the Solv-BTC at least three (3) Business Days prior to the Closing Date. The Purchaser shall initiate the transfer of the requisite amount of Solv-BTC to the designated wallet address on or before the Closing Date and shall provide the Company with reasonable evidence of such transfer, including the blockchain transaction hash and confirmation. The Purchaser’s obligation to pay the Purchase Price shall be deemed fully satisfied only upon confirmation on the applicable blockchain that the Company has received the full amount of Solv-BTC in its designated digital wallet. If the spot price of Solv-BTC reported by CoinMarketCap is unavailable or materially disrupted at the Reference Time, the Reference Rate shall instead be determined by reference to a second independent and internationally recognized pricing source agreed by the Parties in writing. If, as of 5:00 p.m. New York City time on the Business Day immediately preceding the Closing Date, the aggregate U.S. Dollar value of the Solv-BTC required to be delivered hereunder (valued at the then-current spot price reported by CoinMarketCap) is less than ninety-five percent (95%) of the aggregate Purchase Price, the Purchaser shall deliver at the Closing such additional Solv-BTC as is necessary so that the aggregate U.S. Dollar value so delivered is not less than the aggregate Purchase Price.","context":"The number of units of Solv-BTC to be delivered at the Closing shall be calculated by dividing the Purchase Price by the Reference Rate (as defined above), rounded down to four (4) decimal places.","section":"","block":32,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"fbb780a304a6de276e8c40e67111bfd0ed8aeda6f0d22b6bfd81f165b063afde","quote":"(a) 购买人应通过交付一定数量的 Solv-BTC 支付购买价格。该等 Solv-BTC 的美元价值应等于购买价格。每单位 Solv-BTC 的美元价值应等于 CoinMarketCap（coinmarketcap.com）于定价日前一个营业日纽约市时间下午 5:00（“参考时间”）所报告的 Solv-BTC 现货价格（“参考汇率”）。","context":"ignated wallet address on or before the Closing Date and shall provide the Company with reasonable evidence of such transfer, including the blockchain transaction hash and confirmation. The Purchaser’s obligation to pay the Purchase Price shall be deemed fully satisfied only upon confirmation on the applicable blockchain that the Company has received the full amount of Solv-BTC in its designated digital wallet. If the spot price of Solv-BTC reported by CoinMarketCap is unavailable or materially disrupted at the Reference Time, the Reference Rate shall instead be determined by reference to a second independent and internationally recognized pricing source agreed by the Parties in writing. If, as of 5:00 p.m. New York City time on the Business Day immediately preceding the Closing Date, the aggregate U.S. Dollar value of the Solv-BTC required to be delivered hereunder (valued at the then-current spot price reported by CoinMarketCap) is less than ninety-five percent (95%) of the aggregate Purchase Price, the Purchaser shall deliver at the Closing such additional Solv-BTC as is necessary so that the aggregate U.S. Dollar value so delivered is not less than the aggregate Purchase Price.","section":"","block":33,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"15b4038d7ef3f97e00d40a39d7681beafd19fccede2887cdbaf7695377176116","quote":"于交割应交付的 Solv-BTC 单位数量应为购买价格除以参考汇率，向下取整至四（4）位小数。公司应在交割日至少三（3）个营业日前向购买人提供指定的数字钱包地址，用于接收 Solv-BTC。购买人应在交割日或之前发起将足额 Solv-BTC 转账至指定钱包地址，并向公司提供合理的交易证明，包括区块链交易哈希及确认信息。购买人支付购买价格的义务仅在公司指定数字钱包中经适用区块链网络确认收到足额 Solv-BTC 后，方视为完全履行。如于参考时间CoinMarketCap所报Solv-BTC现货价格无法获得或出现重大异常，参考汇率应改按双方书面同意的另一独立且国际公认的价格来源确定。如于交割日前一个营业日纽约市时间下午5:00，按CoinMarketCap当时现货价格计算的应交付Solv-BTC美元总值低于购买价格总额的百分之九十五（95%），购买人应于交割时交付额外的Solv-BTC，使所交付总值不低于购买价格总额","context":"(a) 购买人应通过交付一定数量的 Solv-BTC 支付购买价格。该等 Solv-BTC 的美元价值应等于购买价格。每单位 Solv-BTC 的美元价值应等于 CoinMarketCap（coinmarketcap.com）于定价日前一个营业日纽约市时间下午 5:00（“参考时间”）所报告的 Solv-BTC 现货价格（“参考汇率”）。","section":"","block":34,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"e119100675ef189f6abcb70bd113015a274d32f4dd66a1dc1973ed8381eaa9df","quote":"(f) The Purchaser represents and warrants that it has good and marketable title to the Solv-BTC delivered in payment of the Purchase Price, free and clear of all liens, encumbrances and adverse claims, and that such Solv-BTC is not subject to any lock-up, vesting, escrow or smart-contract transfer restriction. The Purchaser further acknowledges and agrees that the U.S. federal securities-law characterization of Solv-BTC is uncertain and that, under the joint interpretation of the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission and the Commodity Futures Trading Commission issued on March 17, 2026, a crypto asset that is acquired from, or whose value depends on the continuing managerial efforts or representations of, an issuer or project team may be subject to an investment contract; the Purchaser assumes all risk of such characterization with respect to the Solv-BTC and shall have no claim against the Company arising therefrom. The representations and acknowledgment in this Section 1.2(f) are in addition to, and consistent with, the Purchaser’s representations in Exhibit C.","context":"3","section":"","block":45,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"d9a84ca81819ba1e92125abc1ea77f9d6fdb0930352548f7737203f67500010e","quote":"(f) 购买人陈述并保证，其对为支付购买价格而交付的Solv-BTC拥有良好且可流通的所有权，不存在任何留置权、权利负担或不利主张，且该等Solv-BTC不受任何锁定、归属、托管或智能合约转让限制。购买人进一步确认并同意，Solv-BTC在美国联邦证券法下的定性尚不确定；根据美国证券交易委员会与商品期货交易委员会于2026年3月17日发布的联合解释，自发行人或项目方取得、或其价值取决于发行人或项目方持续管理努力或陈述的加密资产，可能构成投资合同；购买人承担Solv-BTC相关定性的全部风险，并不得就此对公司提出任何主张。本第1.2(f)节的陈述与确认系对购买人在附录C中陈述的补充，且与之一致。","context":"(f) The Purchaser represents and warrants that it has good and marketable title to the Solv-BTC delivered in payment of the Purchase Price, free and clear of all liens, encumbrances and adverse claims, and that such Solv-BTC is not subject to any lock-up, vesting, escrow or smart-contract transfer restriction. The Purchaser further acknowledges and agrees that the U.S. federal securities-law characterization of Solv-BTC is uncertain and that, under the joint interpretation of the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission and the Commodity Futures Trading Commission issued on March 17, 2026, a crypto asset that is acquired from, or whose value depends on the continuing managerial efforts or representations of, an issuer or project team may be subject to an investment contract; the Purchaser assumes all risk of such characterization with respect to the Solv-BTC and shall have no claim against the Company arising therefrom. The representations and acknowledgment in this Section 1.2(f) are in addition to, and consistent with, the Purchaser’s representations in Exhibit C.","section":"","block":46,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"42a95034b845d13ded4b1df18079c6d43c4b34bb0ab37d69054b491f2ff1509c","quote":"Section 6.1 General Indemnity. The Company agrees to indemnify and hold harmless the Purchaser (and their respective directors, officers, managers, partners, members, shareholders, affiliates, agents, successors and assigns) from and against any and all losses, liabilities, deficiencies, costs, damages and expenses (including, without limitation, reasonable attorneys’ fees, charges and disbursements) incurred by the Purchaser as a result of any inaccuracy in or breach of the representations, warranties or covenants made by the Company herein. The Purchaser, severally but not jointly, agrees to indemnify and hold harmless the Company and its directors, officers, affiliates, agents, successors and assigns from and against any and all losses, liabilities, deficiencies, costs, damages and expenses (including, without limitation, reasonable attorneys’ fees, charges and disbursements) incurred by the Company as a result of any inaccuracy in or breach of the representations, warranties or covenants made by such Purchaser herein. The maximum aggregate liability of the Purchaser pursuant to its indemnification obligations under this Article VI shall not exceed the portion of the Purchase Price paid by the Purchaser hereunder. In no event shall any “Indemnified Party” (as defined below) be entitled to recover consequential or punitive damages resulting from a breach or violation of this Agreement. Notwithstanding the foregoing, except in the case of fraud, willful misconduct or breach of a Fundamental Representation (in each of which cases liability shall be uncapped), the maximum aggregate liability of the Company under this Article VI shall not exceed the Purchase Price. No Indemnified Party shall be entitled to indemnification under this Article VI until the aggregate indemnifiable losses, liabilities, costs, damages and expenses (“Losses”) exceed US$100,000 (the “Basket”), whereupon the Indemnified Party may recover all Losses from the first dollar. As security for the Purchaser’s representations as to title to, and the lawful source of, the Solv-BTC, 10% of the Solv-BTC delivered at the Closing (the “Holdback”) shall be held in escrow for 12 months following the Closing pursuant to an escrow agreement in form and substance reasonably acceptable to the Parties. For purposes of this Agreement, “Fundamental Representations” means the representations and warranties in Sections 2.1(a), 2.1(b), 2.1(d), 2.1(n), 2.2(a) and 2.2(b) and the Purchaser’s anti-money-laundering, sanctions and title representations.","context":"补偿","section":"","block":230,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-083046","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-07-30","cik":"0001747661","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1747661/000121390026083046/ea029979901ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14.bin","sha256":"e1e35ba6fef9cbeec770a48f0bf5898210bc70ffc66b04740a2e0bb2a1b7fd14"}},{"id":"59f7f97618b5923a72cfa9677efd4c52d32b5188b85e933ce36b536f9352b711","quote":"第6.1节 常规补偿。公司同意补偿购买人（及其各自的董事会成员，高级职员，管理层人员，合伙人，成员，股东，附属机构，代理人，继承人和子实体）并保证其免受任何及所有的损失，责任，短缺，费用，损害赔偿和花销（包括但不限于，合理的律师费），以上所有损失都由购买人承担的，因公司做出的保证，陈述和协议中的不准确或违反了其中条款而产生。购买人同意分别但不连带的补偿公司及其董事会成员，附属机构，代理人，继承者和子实体，并使其免受任何及所有的损失，责任，短缺，费用，损害赔偿和花销（包括但不限于，合理的律师费），以上所有损失是由公司承担的，因购买人做出的保证，陈述和协议中的不准确或违反了其中条款而产生。购买人依此第6.1条中所述补偿而承担的最大的总责任不得超过此购买人所支付的购买价格。任何“受补偿方” （定义见下）不得享有因违反此协议而引起的间接损害赔偿或惩罚性损害赔偿。尽管有前述规定，除欺诈、故意不当行为或违反基本陈述（在该等情形下责任不设上限）外，公司根据本第六条承担的最高责任总额不得超过购买价格。在受补偿方的累计损失超过100,000美元（“免赔额”）之前，任何受补偿方均无权依本第六条获得补偿；一旦超过，受补偿方可自第一美元起就全部损失获得补偿。为担保购买人关于其对Solv-BTC的所有权及合法来源的陈述，于交割交付的Solv-BTC的10%（“预留款”）应根据双方合理接受的形式与内容的托管协议在交割后12个月内予以托管。就本协议而言，“基本陈述”指第2.1(a)、2.1(b)、2.1(d)、2.1(n)、2.2(a)及2.2(b)节以及购买人关于反洗钱、制裁与所有权的陈述与保证。","context":"nitive damages resulting from a breach or violation of this Agreement. Notwithstanding the foregoing, except in the case of fraud, willful misconduct or breach of a Fundamental Representation (in each of which cases liability shall be uncapped), the maximum aggregate liability of the Company under this Article VI shall not exceed the Purchase Price. No Indemnified Party shall be entitled to indemnification under this Article VI until the aggregate indemnifiable losses, liabilities, costs, damages and expenses (“Losses”) exceed US$100,000 (the “Basket”), whereupon the Indemnified Party may recover all Losses from the first dollar. As security for the Purchaser’s representations as to title to, and the lawful source of, the Solv-BTC, 10% of the Solv-BTC delivered at the Closing (the “Holdback”) shall be held in escrow for 12 months following the Closing pursuant to an escrow agreement in form and substance reasonably acceptable to the Parties. For purposes of this Agreement, “Fundamental Representations” means the representations and warranties in Sections 2.1(a), 2.1(b), 2.1(d), 2.1(n), 2.2(a) and 2.2(b) and the Pur